window.products.push({"id":934283,"name":"Avira Home Holiday Hand Towels Set, Pack of 4, Soft Large Hand Towels 16”x28”, 100% Cotton Embroidered Christmas Towels, Perfect for Home Gift, Machin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YHbrAJoxS._AC_.jpg","description":"Cotton This set includes 4 pieces of 100% Cotton, 2 red and 2 white, large hand towels, 16\"x28\" each. Woven to be lightweight and quick to dry. It has a beautiful bells embroidery on the towel pile, perfect for gifting or to add a festive cheer to your bathroom or powder room. SOFT AND ABSORBENT: Made from 100% ringspun cotton which has been combed to remove any impurities. The result is a softer and smoother towel, which is extremely absorbent. DIRECT FROM MANUFACTURER: We are manufacturers of home textiles for more than 40 years. We bring, directly from the mill to your doorstep highest quality products at outstanding prices. All our products are tested and certified by internationally accredited labs. LASTING COLOR: Dyed using reactive dyes, which gives it lasting color even after multiple washes. Machine washable and dryable. ECO FRIENDLY AND SAFE: We are a OEKO TEX Standard 100 approved factory, as per globally standardized quality assurance system. This ensures that our products do not contain any harmful substances, and are safe for the skin and environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YHbrAJoxS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avira Home","source_asin":"B07G3D9M2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G3D9M2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G3D9M2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934284,"name":"Cotton Mesh Grocery Bags - Reusable Grocery Net Bags - 100% Cotton Mesh Tote Shopping Bags - French Market Bags - Premium Cotton String Bags for Farme","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iLP4w6hML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌎 ECO FRIENDLY COTTON STRING GROCERY BAGS - Make the eco-conscious choice when it comes to your shopping and grocery bags! Our reusable cotton string grocery bags bags help reduce the carbon footprint and minimize plastic pollution that clogs landfills and harms delicate ecosystems & waterways. These bags are sustainably crafted with 100% organic cotton. ✅ MULTI-PURPOSE MESH GROCERY BAGS - Enjoy the tons of versatile uses you'll get out of this woven mesh bag made of cotton. Fantastic for carrying and storage of fruits & veggies, grocery items, farmer's market selections, bread and baked goods. This string shopping bag also makes a perfect beach bag, tote bag, pool & activities bag, toy storage, net market bag and gym bag. 🌱 LIGHTWEIGHT FRENCH MARKET BAGS - Want to get a 70s European look? This bag is perfect. Despite its large storage bag volume, the material of this fishnet bag is fine enough to roll up into a nearly pocket sized package that's easy to tuck away or keep in your purse, backpack, or car. Organic cotton is 100% biodegradable and compostable. ♻️ STRONG AND DURABLE FARMERS MARKET BAGS - If you are making a trip to your farmers market then these bags are perfect. It is light in weight but expertly crafted and woven for maximum strength and long-lasting durability. Each mesh market bag can expand to hold up to 40 lbs - significantly more than the capacity of any plastic shopping bag. Feel empowered with a shopping bag option that lets you reduce, reuse, and recycle! 💧 100% MACHINE WASHABLE PRODUCE - The problem with most reusable grocery bags is that the fabric ends up dirty, stained or sticky over time from contact with foods. The wonderful thing about our reusable bags is that the cotton mesh material is easy to clean, hand & machine washable, and super quick-drying. Join tons of customers raving about these versatile multi-use bags... Click 'Add to Cart' or 'Buy Now' Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iLP4w6hML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Organic Cotton Mart","source_asin":"B07S64TG3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S64TG3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S64TG3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
