window.products.push({"id":934338,"name":"Trends International Lisa Parker - Protector Of Magic Wall Poster, 22.375\" x 34\", Unframed Version","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GxpvUjh1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Trends International wall posters are everyone's favorite room decor! Our posters are created with high-resolution artwork and are printed on glossy poster paper which enhances the colors to make a bold wall decor statement in any room. Decorate the bedroom, bathroom, kid's room, living room, office, dorm, and more! Our art prints are lightweight and ready-to-frame or they can be hung on the wall using poster mounts, clips, push pins, or nails. Add these decorations alongside the other accessories on your party supplies list too! Trends International's wall posters are the perfect way to dress up your parties. Posters make great gifts as well! Whether it's for a birthday, Christmas, house warming or for your best friend, they'll love receiving a high-quality poster to show off their style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GxpvUjh1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trends International","source_asin":"B0BMH4DWWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMH4DWWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMH4DWWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934339,"name":"MIU France Stainless Steel Salad Spinner with Crank Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZHE39WKNL._AC_.jpg","description":"This easy pull stainless steel salad spinner could possibly turn carnivores into vegetarians, it's so simple and fun to use. The foolproof, retractable cord mechanism works with the unique glide wheel to smoothly and efficiently spin greens and other food free of water, leaving them clean and ready for tossing with other salad ingredients, for sautéing or adding to other dishes. A smooth, no-rib basket is gentle enough to use with fresh berries. Dressings will no longer be watery, and everything you spin will come out drier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZHE39WKNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIU France","source_asin":"B0006IVXTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006IVXTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006IVXTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934340,"name":"Non Stick Skillet Frying Pan: Premium Aluminum Fry Pans with Glass Lid & Stainless Steel Handle - Non-Stick Saute Pan - Dishwasher & Oven Safe (10 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bKpGYreoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEAVY DUTY  When it comes to cookware like skillets, you need a pan that will stand up to the daily wear and tear of the kitchen. If you’re looking for durability and functionality, the expertly crafted 10 inch Almond frying pan is a must-have for all kitchens and cooking levels. Designed with a thick 3.0 mm gauge construction, our pan provides superior, even heat distribution and durability. With slightly sloped sides and flared edges, this is the perfect pan for cooking omelettes and eggs or sauteing other foods. This pan can be used with gas, electric and induction cooktops. It’s also oven safe up to 450 degrees F.   DURABLE NONSTICK COATING  Is there anything worse than food sticking to your frying pan when you’re cooking? Even when you grease or oil the cooking surface, many pans just don’t stand up to the test. The Almond frying pan boasts a 3 layer coating that adds durability and allows food to release easily from the pan without sticking. And by using a pain with a built-in nonstick surface, you'll be using less oil and making every dish healthier!   STAY COOL HANDLE  The Almond frying pan handle is designed with both comfort and safety in mind. Other skillet handles get hot while cooking, leading to an increased risk of burns. Our ergonomically shaped stainless steel handle is riveted to the pan to reduce heat transfer and provide extra strength.   TEMPERED GLASS LID  To make the cooking process easier, we include a matching glass lid with every Almond skillet order. The tempered glass lid traps heat, allowing you to cook your food faster and keep it warm until you’re ready to plate. You'll also easily be able to monitor your meal throughout the cooking process.   DISHWASHER SAFE  Other skillets force you to hand wash after each use, adding just another chore to your already busy plate. Almond pans are created with no toxic chemicals and are safe for the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bKpGYreoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Almond","source_asin":"B0787RWVJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0787RWVJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0787RWVJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
