window.products.push({"id":934486,"name":"PARACITY Espresso Cups with Wood Handle, Double Spout Glass Measuring Cup with Dual Scale, Espresso Shot Glass with V-Shaped Mouth, Clear Glass Espres","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qxB1vnK8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double V-Shaped Spout】 The espresso cups have V-shaped two-way spouts. The V-shaped drainage nozzle is more convenient to pour and not easy to leak. And the two-way spout allows you to pour easily without turning. So PARACITY double spout glass measuring cup can pour smoothly without staining the tabletop and it is a good helper for your coffee. 【Wooden handle for anti-scalding and heat insulation】 The espresso cup is made of acacia wood handle. Compared with other materials, the wood is hard, has the aroma of nanmu, and is more resistant to corrosion and less likely to mold. The wooden handle is ergonomically designed for easy handling and resists burning. Whether it's espresso liquid fresh from the French press or freshly whipped milk, it won't burn your hands. 【Heat-resistant thick borosilicate glass】 The espresso cups are made of borosilicate glass, which has a stronger texture and more aesthetic appeal. It does not contain lead and chromium, and can be in direct contact with food. Borosilicate glass allows the espresso shot glass to withstand a sudden temperature difference of 20°C-150°C. In addition, the espresso cup is very easy to clean, just a simple hand wash will keep it clean. 【Dual scales available】 There are two clear and accurate scales on the body of the espresso cups, ounces and milliliters, which can meet different needs and let you know the amount to add in each step.The large capacity of 75ml allows you to fill 2 servings of espresso at one time. With this expresso coffee cup you can easily brew your favorite coffee. 【Wide variety of uses】 This espresso accessories are perfect for espresso, milk, milk froth, and whatever your favorite beverage is. In addition, you can also use the milk frothing pitcher to add salad dressing, butter, tomato sauce, etc., and it is also feasible to hold fruit. This glass measuring cup is a good helper for you to DIY your drink or food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qxB1vnK8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARACITY","source_asin":"B0BW93VDHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW93VDHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW93VDHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
