window.products.push({"id":934529,"name":"Jay Franco Mickey Mouse Reloaded 4 Piece, Retro Full Sheet Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aqElgIkOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform any child's bedroom with this super soft microfiber full sheet set featuring your child's favorite Disney character, Mickey mouse. This full bedding sheet set is sure to make any child smile. Each 4 piece, super soft microfiber full sheet set includes a fitted sheet, flat sheet and two standard reversible pillowcases. The bold colors and exciting design will enhance the existing decor of any kid's or toddler bedroom. Fitted sheet measures 54\" x 75\", flat sheet measures 81\" x 96\" with (2) 20\" x 30\" standard pillowcases. 100Percent polyester. Easy care, machine wash cold, tumble dry low. Imported","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aqElgIkOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jay Franco","source_asin":"B0711XX6QR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0711XX6QR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0711XX6QR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934530,"name":"HELLO LAURA - Photo Collage Frame for Wall Family Picture Frams Collage Wall Decor 8 Opening Photos Display for 6\" x 4\" Photo Sockets Black Gallery Wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Iv1yx0N6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Framed photos turn a house into a home. Displaying personal photos and mementos adds warmth to your home and gives it a unique personality. Framed photographs chronicle the things that are special in your life. . The elegant beaded edging around each frame will enhance any decor, whether in your home or office. Constructed of a high-quality acrylic resin, the frames have the look of real wood but are more durable than similar products made from cheaply painted thin pine. These frames have glare resistant glass that will protect your valued photos and memorabilia and keep them safe for years to come. Place your photo gallery where you can appreciate it. Set the frames on a photo ledge or place them on an accent table or piano top. The frames aren’t just for photographs. When setting up your gallery or grouping, add awards and certificates, souvenirs such as ticket stubs, programs, and postcards, children’s artwork, and anything that has meaning to you. This photo frames is a thoughtful gift for any occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Iv1yx0N6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HELLO LAURA","source_asin":"B0B68ZW1TM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B68ZW1TM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B68ZW1TM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934531,"name":"Bonavita 1.7L Variable Gooseneck Electric Kettle and CoastLine Professional Digital Pocket Scale Bundle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413ZJeDwTXL._AC_.jpg","description":"The cordless electric kettle is one of the greatest advancements in kitchen appliance technology. They heat water in a fraction of the time compared to an old school kettle. This electric kettle from Bonavita leaps forward yet again by giving coffee and tea lovers the features they need. The digital control panel and display lets you set the specific temperature of the water in 1 degree increments! It can heat your water between 140 to 212 F. This is essential for coffee that requires water between 195-205 F. For tea, the proper cuppa can be anywhere from 180 for Blooming Tea to 208 for Rooibos! It even has a count up timer for proper brewing & steeping times. This kettle not only gives you the exact temperature you need, but it can hold that desired temperature for up to 60 minutes. With a large 1.7 liter capacity, you can leisurely enjoy multiple cups knowing the last one will be as perfect as the first. The Gooseneck spout is the icing on the cake, allowing you to smoothly and precisely dispense the exact amount of water you want easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413ZJeDwTXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonavita","source_asin":"B018SWB8I4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018SWB8I4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018SWB8I4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
