window.products.push({"id":934533,"name":"Rustic Wood Hair Dryer Holder, Hair Styling and Care Tool Organizer with Natural Rope Handles, Bathroom Countertop Organizer for Blow Dryer Straighten","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QuOKUk0TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exquisite hairstyle is an indispensable part of beauty lovers.However, great hair can be a time consuming investment. To this end, we specially designed a hair dryer storage. Modesign Rustic Style Wooden Hair Tool Storage Organizer ✅If you have a lot of hair product laying around, and you hate cords and clutter,our hair dryer holder will be your best choice to get them sorted and organized. ✅Rustic Style Wooden Storage Organizer, Two colors can be selected. ✅This hair tool organizer is the perfect solution to clean up the counter space and keep your dressing table organized ✅Our sturdy and durable wood hair tool organizer is made of solid wood with stylish rustic surface. ✅Our wooden make up organizer with compact design.The stock your home hair care organizer conveniently orders all your major hair care accessories and more. ✅The hair dryer holder is designed with two twine cords for easy handling. Upgraded version design. 5 grids to make your countertop neat and tidy.  Multi-purpose, can be used as hair dryer holder, hairdressing tool, emulsion finishing agent.  3 heat-resistant steel compartments for storing perm tools.  Save space, provide large capacity for your bathroom counter, restroom, study room 100% natural wood and elegant design All in all, every lady deserves this wooden organizer, and you cannot know how much you like it until you have it. From now on, say goodbye to chaos","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QuOKUk0TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modesign","source_asin":"B08NVMBJ1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVMBJ1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVMBJ1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934534,"name":"Bamboo Steamer Basket 10 Inch with 2 Tiers & Lid for Dim Sum, Meat & Dumplings Steam Cooker Set for Rice, Eggs & Veggies Including Chopsticks, Liner P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E0VlNA37S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY NATURAL BAMBOO - Lightweight, durable, sturdy, well made, and containing, no plastic or metal; Food retains nutrients and maintains flavor, color and texture. YOUR FAVORITE ASIAN FOODS - Cook and serve Dim Sum, Dumplings, Rice, Fish, Vegetables and Meat the traditional way, with our bamboo steamer. EASY TO USE & CLEAN- The large size fits on top of most pots, woks and pans; It is NOT dishwasher safe, but quick to clean by rinsing by hand with vinegar and water. Air dry completely before storing. A HEALTHIER TYPE OF COOKING - Using a bamboo steamer to cook your food is a lot better than frying or grilling. By steaming, rice and other delicacies are gently cooked by the rising steam alone. Delicious flavors and valuable nutrients are not lost through the cooking process. STACKABLE 2-TIER DESIGN - The bamboo steamer features 2 tiers that allow you to cook multiple servings at the same time. You can put fish or dumplings on one tier while cooking rice or vegetables on the other layer. The dome shaped lid is made with an extra tight weave to ensure the perfect cooking temperature, evenly throughout the baskets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E0VlNA37S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kxuhivc","source_asin":"B08YCRZKGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YCRZKGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YCRZKGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
