window.products.push({"id":934639,"name":"The Cooking Guild Professional Paring Knife - 5\" Japanese High Carbon Stainless Steel Fruit Knife Set - Rust-resistand & Razor-Sharp Pairing Knives De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61utw6h1vWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dynasty Pairing Knife - The Perfect Addition to Your Kitchen Arsenal Introducing the Dynasty Petty Knife, a must-have tool for every home cook who values quality and efficiency in their kitchen. Our paring knife features a 5-inch razor-sharp San Mai stainless steel blade that is forged using the traditional Japanese blade-making technique, resulting in a devastatingly sharp, rust-resistant cooking knife that will last a lifetime. The blade is rust-resistant and balanced, making it a great tool for peeling, shaping, slicing fruits and vegetables, and adding those final touches to your meal. With its ergonomic rosewood handle and razor-sharp blade, this knife will quickly become your go-to tool for peeling, slicing, dicing, and shaping. Its thin and rigid Japanese steel blade makes thin and effortless slices through different types of food, including vegetables and meat. Highlights: - Traditional Japanese blade-making technique - Razor-sharp San Mai stainless steel blade - Ergonomic handle for a comfortable grip - Rust-resistant and balanced Whether you are a professional chef or a home cook, the Dynasty Petty Knife is the perfect addition to your kitchen arsenal. Add this versatile and sharp paring knife to your collection and take your cooking to the next level!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61utw6h1vWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Cooking Guild","source_asin":"B0BJ7V3861","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ7V3861","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ7V3861","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934640,"name":"Squish Comfort - X-Large Black 60x20 inch - Anti Fatigue Cushioned Kitchen Mats - Soft Floor Pad for Laundry, Bathroom, Office Standing Desk - Relieve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919cXR2UmeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Name: SquishComfort - BlackTopo Size: X-Large 60”x20”x3/4” Who are we? Squish Solutions is based on Gold Coast Australia. What do we do? We create Squishy things to make everyday life more comfortable. Why did we start this Brand? We found sitting at an office desk all day can lead to health problems such as weight gain, diabetes, heart disease and poor circulation.We setup some standing desks but often found ourselves needing to rest on a stool due to aches or fatigue.Standing too long can lead to other issues such as: general discomfort general discomfort limited concentration and stamina limited concentration and stamina lower back pain lower back pain hyperextension of the leg hyperextension of the leg foot or ankle tendonitis foot or ankle tendonitis + many other problems in the feet, knees, hips and back. Thankfully we discovered anti-fatigue floor mats for standing desks and the bonus is they also work in the kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, laundry, garage or work shop. Why choose a Squish Comfort mat? Other brands sell plain or outdated designs. Our unique modern design looks impressive anywhere in your home or office.We use the highest quality environmentally friendly materials which will maintain the correct softness and resist wear and tear but continue to offer comfortable support under your feet for years.We've tested our mats in busy cafes & retail businesses.The Squish Comfort 'Topo' pattern is subtle enough so you can use it anywhere in the house or office without ever getting tired of looking at it or standing on it. Squish Comfort Mats will work on any floor type: wood wood tile tile carpet carpet concrete concrete vinyl vinyl We guarantee you'll love standing on a Squish Comfort Anti-fatigue Floor Mat!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919cXR2UmeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SquishComfort","source_asin":"B0851CLGYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0851CLGYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0851CLGYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
