window.products.push({"id":934822,"name":"meori Foldable 2 Bottle/2 Pack Wine Tote Lava Black Reusable Hostess Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ckarxQ9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Carry two bottles of wine home from a tasting or to a dinner party with this reusable, stylish tote. Designed to hold different-sized bottles such as Pinot Noir and bubbly. Makes a great gift box for birthdays, housewarming or holiday gifts for both the wine enthusiast or casual wine drinker. The memory Foldable Wine Tote keeps 2 bottles upright and protected and folds completely flat when not in use. One compartment has a divider to keep bottles protected or push it aside as needed. Two cushioned handles allow for a comfortable grip. High-quality, dirt-resistant, water-repellent polyester. Clean easily with damp sponge. memory products are designed to carry, organize and store everyday essentials for life on-the-go. Unfold memory when you need it, and tuck it away when you don't. The new memory products build on our heritage of designing high-quality, stylish foldable boxes to go anywhere and hold anything. memory is the workhorse of household organization and now includes products specifically designed for grocery, wine, hobby and life in the great outdoors. Every product in memory's line is foldable and created to be sturdy, multi-functional and hold up to 65 lbs. Discover how memory can add 'easy' to everything you do. Designed in Germany.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ckarxQ9-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"meori","source_asin":"B07G1V89F1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G1V89F1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G1V89F1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934823,"name":"Santa's Workshop 15\"-18\" Houndstooth, Set of 4 Caroler, RED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+MtmIcwL._AC_SL1397_.jpg","description":"The clear and joyous singing of Christmas carolers is a pleasure to both young and old, and these exquisitely handcrafted 15\" to 18\" Houndstooth Carolers are a beautiful representation of this Christmas magic. You can almost hear the hearty baritone of the father balancing out the higher notes of the children, while the mother steadies the performance with her rich and measured alto. Dressed in Victorian fashion, the men wear high collared coats with houndstooth vests while the ladies are dressed in red dresses and red matching hats with houndstooth trim. Make your holidays fun and festive with this delightful family of carolers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+MtmIcwL._AC_SL1397_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa's Workshop","source_asin":"B08DYFSSBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DYFSSBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DYFSSBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
