window.products.push({"id":934959,"name":"TOP SHELF Blue Happy Birthday Wish Jar ; Personalized Gift Ideas for Him ; Unique and Thoughtful Gifts for Dad, Grandpa, Brother, and Best Friend ; Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eYuwZTGnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Break out of the norm and give a unique and personalized birthday gift with a Top Shelf Birthday Wish Jar. By filling out the wish tickets with thoughtful wishes and joyful memories, you’ll be helping save something that cannot be sold in stores....memories. Help capture all those important moments with a Birthday Wish Jar and enjoy all the memories long after that very special day.TO USE:1.Place the wish jar out at the birthday party with blank tickets and pens where guests can easily find them.2. Guests then fill out tickets with their own personal wishes and memories for the birthday boy to enjoy. He can add in his own wishes and memories too!3. Once the tickets have been filled out, add them to the jar. You'll be surprised at how quickly it fills up!4.Before you know it, the jar is full. Then the special birthday boy can enjoy all the caring wishes and thoughtful words from his friends and family long after the party is over.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eYuwZTGnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOP SHELF","source_asin":"B018EKZTVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018EKZTVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018EKZTVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":934960,"name":"Pink Tones 3 by Sheila Golden, 24x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NMtuT04uL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an abstract watercolor painting of pink and peach flowers.Sheila grew up in the New York area and was painting by the time she started grade school. Her love of nature, flowers, color, and animals has been reflected in her art, which ranges from floral to landscapes, watercolor to acrylic. Her work has been published in greeting cards and in film, having done backgrounds for Sesame Street Television and KQED Public Television. She has received ribbons at numerous festivals, and Sheila's collage art was included in a Calendar of Women Artists. Her paintings have been exhibited in galleries in Santa Fe, NM, San Francisco and New York City. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NMtuT04uL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B072KL4N51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-934960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072KL4N51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072KL4N51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
